          "title": "See that you are offline",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>With no connection, a line at the top of <strong>Chats</strong> says you are offline.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/736d45d17fb855e2.webp",
