        },
        {
          "title": "Write anyway",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Write and send as usual. The message shows <strong>Sending…</strong> while it waits.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/2e8efe5d6bbc8b98.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "It goes by itself",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>When the connection comes back, the message goes by itself. Open the chat again to see <strong>Read by 1</strong> once someone has read it.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/db1f7f2af7c3cea6.webp",
